The Materials are provided “AS IS”, WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. In no event shall Owner be liable for damages arising out of use or inability to use the Materials. Recipient is solely responsible for compliance with all applicable laws and regulations related to their use of the Materials.

